{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879526",
      "title": "Animate List Item Movement",
      "lectureOrder": 208,
      "videoOrder": 183,
      "sourceHash": "33e9864488d82e1fb78e194fd5ac7d6498d1e4e0a8fb844400e1d4fe388ea7e3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.27,
          "end": 3.96,
          "en": "Now, how can vue help us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 7.12,
          "en": "with this snapping behavior we got here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.12,
          "end": 9.74,
          "en": "which is not too nice to look at?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.74,
          "end": 12.23,
          "en": "It adds a never special clause",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.23,
          "end": 14.89,
          "en": "when you're using transition group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.89,
          "end": 17.72,
          "en": "So when it's actually controlling multiple elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.72,
          "end": 19.3,
          "en": "instead of just one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.3,
          "end": 21.57,
          "en": "Because you might not notice it actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.57,
          "end": 24.15,
          "en": "whilst we're only adding and removing one element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.15,
          "end": 25.61,
          "en": "at a time here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.61,
          "end": 30.15,
          "en": "we are animating multiple elements simultaneously",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.15,
          "end": 32.31,
          "en": "because the other elements also need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 35.95,
          "en": "to switch their position when a new item is added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.95,
          "end": 37.75,
          "en": "And that's why we use transition group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.75,
          "end": 40.903,
          "en": "It is capable of animating multiple elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.25,
          "end": 44.96,
          "en": "And it gives us a special clause therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.96,
          "end": 47.16,
          "en": "which allows us to control the animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.16,
          "end": 48.75,
          "en": "of the other elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 51.08,
          "en": "which are not getting added or removed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.08,
          "end": 53.82,
          "en": "but which also might need to move around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.82,
          "end": 55.96,
          "en": "to make place for the new element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.96,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "or to fill up the space of the leaving element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 63.16,
          "en": "And the special clause we add here is our prefix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.16,
          "end": 65.363,
          "en": "So user list in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 68.62,
          "en": "since that's the prefix we defined here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.62,
          "end": 70.82,
          "en": "with the name property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.82,
          "end": 71.68,
          "en": "and then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.7,
          "end": 75.78999999999999,
          "en": "dash move.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.78999999999999,
          "end": 78.23,
          "en": "That's another special CSS clause,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.23,
          "end": 82.06,
          "en": "which vue will add to all the other elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.06,
          "end": 84.173,
          "en": "which are not entering or leaving.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.91,
          "end": 87.71000000000001,
          "en": "And even better than that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.71000000000001,
          "end": 90.25,
          "en": "vue will automatically move them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.25,
          "end": 93.22999999999999,
          "en": "to their new place under the hood,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.22999999999999,
          "end": 96.22,
          "en": "by using the transform CSS property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.22,
          "end": 97.82,
          "en": "That's just something you have to know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.82,
          "end": 100.69,
          "en": "Vue will use transform under the hood",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.69,
          "end": 102.05,
          "en": "for moving the elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.05,
          "end": 105.743,
          "en": "which are not added or removed around to their new position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.02000000000001,
          "end": 109.36,
          "en": "And therefore, here in the move class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.36,
          "end": 112.56,
          "en": "we can actually transition the transform property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.56,
          "end": 113.95,
          "en": "on those elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.95,
          "end": 118.44,
          "en": "Let's say over dot eight seconds with a ease function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.44,
          "end": 122.1,
          "en": "So just ease to distribute the time evenly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.1,
          "end": 124.3,
          "en": "Now, if we save that and go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.3,
          "end": 128.433,
          "en": "we'll be able to see that if we reload and add a new user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.21,
          "end": 131.58,
          "en": "Praveen, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.58,
          "end": 134.39,
          "en": "You see the upper elements move smoothly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.39,
          "end": 135.593,
          "en": "to their new position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.77,
          "end": 140.55,
          "en": "Now, if you reload and try this for removing though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.55,
          "end": 143.82,
          "en": "we still have this snapping behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.82,
          "end": 147.31,
          "en": "There's one thing we got to fix for that to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.31,
          "end": 150.88,
          "en": "on the leave active clause.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.88,
          "end": 153.38,
          "en": "So, which is added to the leaving element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.38,
          "end": 157.233,
          "en": "We need to add a position of absolute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.92000000000002,
          "end": 163.92000000000002,
          "en": "Once we add that to the leaving element, and I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.11,
          "end": 167.45,
          "en": "now you'll see the other elements move as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.45,
          "end": 170.12,
          "en": "And they move to their new position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.12,
          "end": 171.88,
          "en": "Now, the rest of the page jumps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.88,
          "end": 174.14,
          "en": "but that's something we can't avoid here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.14,
          "end": 175.63,
          "en": "But inside of that list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.63,
          "end": 180.373,
          "en": "we have a smooth animation for entering items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.989,
          "end": 184.63,
          "en": "But also for leaving items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.63,
          "end": 188.09,
          "en": "and for the rest of the list for all the items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.09,
          "end": 190.88,
          "en": "that need to move to a new position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.88,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "And that is how transition group can help us here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.16,
          "end": 197.55,
          "en": "It allows us to animate items in a list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.55,
          "end": 199.96,
          "en": "multiple items at the same time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.96,
          "end": 202.84,
          "en": "it allows us to move items smoothly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.84,
          "end": 205.126,
          "en": "even if they're not directly affected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.126,
          "end": 208.66,
          "en": "So even if they're not the added or removed item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 208.66,
          "end": 212.45,
          "en": "And therefore, it is the component you should use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.45,
          "end": 215.03,
          "en": "if you want to add multiple items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.03,
          "end": 219.29,
          "en": "If you have one item or two alternating items you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.29,
          "end": 221.21,
          "en": "to animate, transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.21,
          "end": 222.973,
          "en": "is the component you should use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.95,
          "end": 226.41,
          "en": "Because that component is optimized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.41,
          "end": 228.32999999999998,
          "en": "for animating single items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 228.32999999999998,
          "end": 231.513,
          "en": "or alternating items like these two buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
